# Track only the data files referenced by reproducing_paper_plots.md;
# all other simulation outputs in data/ stay ignored. To add a new
# data file to the published set: add a command referencing it to
# reproducing_paper_plots.md, then add a corresponding `!data/<file>`
# line below. The full list can be regenerated via:
#   grep -oE 'data/[^ ]+\.jld2' reproducing_paper_plots.md | sort -u
data/*

